     1→/*
     2→ * PROD-002 — the product web shell stylesheet (the ONE CSS approach: plain
     3→ * CSS, mobile-first, no preprocessor).
     4→ *
     5→ * Design tokens are CSS custom properties. The honesty system has dedicated
     6→ * classes: .epistemic-* (epistemic vocabulary), .tag-derived, .sigma,
     7→ * .source-note, .data-badge-* — every surface reuses them so proposed /
     8→ * observed / derived / uncertain values are ALWAYS visually distinct.
     9→ */
    10→
    11→:root {
    12→  --bg: #f4f6f8;
